  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Audio sources on avatars seem to break randomly. They eventually reach a point where they can be heard across the entire world, and are super crackly. No difference between logarithmic falloff and linear falloff, spread, or no spread, min distance of 0, or more than 0. Checking the \"Use AudioSource Volume Curve\" box doesn't fix the issue either.\nVideo: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kJ8XmWOAlUk",
